            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "NancyLou"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious!! I used more kumquats...first time using them - yum! Parsley instead of cilantro, as a personal preference. I added the zest from the lemon before juicing...hate to see good zest go to waste! ...and just because I had some to use up, I threw in some dried cranberries, but the salad was just as wonderful with or without them!",
            "datePublished": "2016-02-04T14:54:33.620Z"
          },
          {
