            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Marie C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a nice side that would be good with sauted scallops, shrimp or a citrus fish dish. I added a bit more lemon and salt. With the leftovers I added Jarlsberg cheese and grape tomatoes. It made a very nice lunch.",
            "datePublished": "2009-03-04T18:21:35.130Z"
          },
          {
