            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AmandaOT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is amazing! I made this for a friend and ended up making another batch for myself- dressing is light and delicious. I used english cucumbers and doubled the pears. I had to research how to use kumquats. You just wash them and chop them, skin and all. They can be very seedy, so be sure to remove them.",
            "datePublished": "2008-03-21T07:10:50.010Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
