            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pasomomma"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I live in an area that I cannot find kumquats, although I do have a tree that only produces in the early spring. I love kumbquats and quinoa so this is the perfect combo! Very refreshing! Next time (next year) I think I'll add purple onion to it.",
            "datePublished": "2006-08-14T17:39:23.390Z"
